[{"id":"istahzaa-15-11-7","words":["verb:istahzaa"],"options":[{"bs":"ismijavaju","en":"they mock"},{"bs":"i biva ismijan","en":"and he/it is mocked"},{"bs":"ismijan je","en":"he/it was mocked"},{"bs":"ismijavate","en":"you (all) mock"}],"ref":"15:11","answerWord":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","answerSound":"audio/c359f3765c007f08ceb3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And never came there unto them a messenger but they did mock him.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ismijavati, rugati se","en":"to mock, to ridicule"},"passage":["وَمَا","يَأْتِيهِم","مِّن","رَّسُولٍ","إِلَّا","كَانُوا۟","بِهِۦ","يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَهْزَأَ"}},{"id":"istahzaa-6-10-1","words":["verb:istahzaa"],"options":[{"bs":"ismijan je","en":"he/it was mocked"},{"bs":"ruga se","en":"mocks"},{"bs":"ismijavajte!","en":"(you all) mock!"},{"bs":"ismijavate","en":"you (all) mock"}],"ref":"6:10","answerWord":"ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","answerSound":"audio/5481bec17deeaadd5b42.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Messengers (of Allah) have been derided before thee, but that whereat they scoffed surrounded such of them as did deride.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ismijavati, rugati se","en":"to mock, to ridicule"},"passage":["وَلَقَدِ","ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","بِرُسُلٍ","مِّن","قَبْلِكَ","فَحَاقَ","بِٱلَّذِينَ","سَخِرُوا۟","مِنْهُم","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","بِهِۦ","يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَهْزَأَ"}},{"id":"istahzaa-2-15-1","words":["verb:istahzaa"],"options":[{"bs":"ruga se","en":"mocks"},{"bs":"ismijavajte!","en":"(you all) mock!"},{"bs":"ismijavate","en":"you (all) mock"},{"bs":"ismijavaju","en":"they mock"}],"ref":"2:15","answerWord":"يَسْتَهْزِئُ","answerSound":"audio/a23d63c58d9b898f010b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah (Himself) doth mock them, leaving them to wander blindly on in their contumacy.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ismijavati, rugati se","en":"to mock, to ridicule"},"passage":["ٱللَّهُ","يَسْتَهْزِئُ","بِهِمْ","وَيَمُدُّهُمْ","فِى","طُغْيَٰنِهِمْ","يَعْمَهُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَهْزَأَ"}},{"id":"istahzaa-9-64-11","words":["verb:istahzaa"],"options":[{"bs":"ismijavajte!","en":"(you all) mock!"},{"bs":"ismijavaju","en":"they mock"},{"bs":"ismijavate","en":"you (all) mock"},{"bs":"i biva ismijan","en":"and he/it is mocked"}],"ref":"9:64","answerWord":"ٱسْتَهْزِءُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/4a6138a4ea090fcb312d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The hypocrites fear lest a surah should be revealed concerning them, proclaiming what is in their hearts. Say: Scoff (your fill)! Lo! Allah is disclosing what ye fear.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ismijavati, rugati se","en":"to mock, to ridicule"},"passage":["يَحْذَرُ","ٱلْمُنَٰفِقُونَ","أَن","تُنَزَّلَ","عَلَيْهِمْ","سُورَةٌ","تُنَبِّئُهُم","بِمَا","فِى","قُلُوبِهِمْ","قُلِ","ٱسْتَهْزِءُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","مُخْرِجٌ","مَّا","تَحْذَرُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَهْزَأَ"}},{"id":"istahzaa-9-65-12","words":["verb:istahzaa"],"options":[{"bs":"ismijavate","en":"you (all) mock"},{"bs":"ismijan je","en":"he/it was mocked"},{"bs":"ruga se","en":"mocks"},{"bs":"ismijavaju","en":"they mock"}],"ref":"9:65","answerWord":"تَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","answerSound":"audio/0643c86385b550c139a6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if thou ask them (O Muhammad) they will say: We did but talk and jest. Say: Was it at Allah and His revelations and His messenger that ye did scoff?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ismijavati, rugati se","en":"to mock, to ridicule"},"passage":["وَلَئِن","سَأَلْتَهُمْ","لَيَقُولُنَّ","إِنَّمَا","كُنَّا","نَخُوضُ","وَنَلْعَبُ","قُلْ","أَبِٱللَّهِ","وَءَايَٰتِهِۦ","وَرَسُولِهِۦ","كُنتُمْ","تَسْتَهْزِءُونَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَهْزَأَ"}},{"id":"farraqa-30-32-2","words":["verb:farraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"razjedinili su","en":"they divided"},{"bs":"razdvajamo","en":"we separate"},{"bs":"razdvojio si","en":"you separated"},{"bs":"razdvajaju","en":"they separate"}],"ref":"30:32","answerWord":"فَرَّقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/32b5771ccf310e410fae.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Of those who split up their religion and became schismatics, each sect exulting in its tenets.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"razdvojiti, podijeliti","en":"to separate, to distribute"},"passage":["مِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","فَرَّقُوا۟","دِينَهُمْ","وَكَانُوا۟","شِيَعًا","كُلُّ","حِزْبٍۭ","بِمَا","لَدَيْهِمْ","فَرِحُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"فَرَّقَ"}},{"id":"farraqa-20-94-11","words":["verb:farraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"razdvojio si","en":"you separated"},{"bs":"razdvajaju","en":"they separate"},{"bs":"razdvajamo","en":"we separate"},{"bs":"razjedinili su","en":"they divided"}],"ref":"20:94","answerWord":"فَرَّقْتَ","answerSound":"audio/d7915a5ba2159c027525.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: O son of my mother! Clutch not my beard nor my head! I feared lest thou shouldst say: Thou hast caused division among the Children of Israel, and hast not waited for my word.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"razdvojiti, podijeliti","en":"to separate, to distribute"},"passage":["قَالَ","يَبْنَؤُمَّ","لَا","تَأْخُذْ","بِلِحْيَتِى","وَلَا","بِرَأْسِىٓ","إِنِّى","خَشِيتُ","أَن","تَقُولَ","فَرَّقْتَ","بَيْنَ","بَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","وَلَمْ","تَرْقُبْ","قَوْلِى"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"فَرَّقَ"}}]